  user_input {
    user_response: "You are a Principal Software Architect, Senior Backend Engineer, Senior Frontend Engineer, DevOps Engineer, Database Architect, and UI/UX Engineer.\n\nYour task is to build THEIAKSHI ONE Enterprise HRMS from scratch.\n\nThis is NOT a demo project.\n\nIt must be production-ready.\n\n=====================================================\nPROJECT NAME\n=====================================================\n\nTHEIAKSHI ONE Enterprise HRMS\n\nCompany\n\nTHEIAKSHI ENTERPRISES\n\n=====================================================\nTECH STACK\n=====================================================\n\nFrontend\n---------\nReact 19\nTypeScript\nVite\nMaterial UI\nReact Query (TanStack)\nReact Hook Form\nReact Router\nAxios\nZod\n\nBackend\n---------\nNode.js\nExpress\nTypeScript\n\nDatabase\n---------\nPostgreSQL\nNeon Database\n\nAuthentication\n---------\nJWT\nRefresh Tokens\nbcrypt\n\nStorage\n---------\nCloudinary (documents/images)\n\nNotifications\n---------\nFirebase Cloud Messaging\n\nRealtime\n---------\nSocket.io\n\nCharts\n---------\nRecharts\n\nDeployment\n---------\nFrontend \342\206\222 Render\n\nBackend \342\206\222 Render\n\nDatabase \342\206\222 Neon\n\n=====================================================\nARCHITECTURE\n=====================================================\n\nUse proper enterprise architecture.\n\nbackend\n\nsrc\n\ncontrollers\n\nservices\n\nrepositories\n\nroutes\n\nmiddlewares\n\ndatabase\n\nconfig\n\ntypes\n\nutils\n\nvalidators\n\nfrontend\n\nsrc\n\ncomponents\n\npages\n\nhooks\n\nservices\n\ncontexts\n\nlayouts\n\nroutes\n\nutils\n\ntypes\n\nEvery API must follow\n\nController\n\n\342\206\223\n\nService\n\n\342\206\223\n\nRepository\n\n\342\206\223\n\nPostgreSQL\n\nNo SQL inside controllers.\n\nNo SQL inside React.\n\n=====================================================\nDATABASE\n=====================================================\n\nNO JSON\n\nNO LOCAL STORAGE\n\nNO MOCK DATA\n\nNO DATABASE.JSON\n\nEverything must come from PostgreSQL.\n\nEvery module must have\n\nCREATE TABLE\n\nIndexes\n\nForeign Keys\n\nSeed Data\n\n=====================================================\nMODULES\n=====================================================\n\nAuthentication\n\nEmployees\n\nAttendance\n\nLeave\n\nPayroll\n\nExpenses\n\nProjects\n\nRecruitment\n\nAssets\n\nNotifications\n\nDocuments\n\nTimesheets\n\nHelpdesk\n\nBranches\n\nCelebrations\n\nAnnouncements\n\nOrganization Chart\n\nPerformance Reviews\n\nAI Assistant\n\nWeekly Planner\n\n=====================================================\nDASHBOARD\n=====================================================\n\nEverything database driven.\n\nNO hardcoded arrays.\n\nWidgets\n\nEmployee Count\n\nDepartment Distribution\n\nAttendance Today\n\nLate Arrivals\n\nLeave Requests\n\nPayroll Summary\n\nRecent Activity\n\nAnnouncements\n\nCelebrations\n\nQuick Actions\n\nMorning Brief\n\nAI Insights\n\nWeekly Tasks\n\nEvery widget must have its own API.\n\nExample\n\nGET\n\n/api/v1/dashboard/metrics\n\n/api/v1/dashboard/activity\n\n/api/v1/dashboard/attendance\n\n/api/v1/dashboard/payroll\n\n/api/v1/dashboard/announcements\n\n/api/v1/dashboard/departments\n\n=====================================================\nAPI STANDARDS\n=====================================================\n\nREST API\n\nEvery endpoint returns\n\n{\nsuccess,\nmessage,\ndata\n}\n\nNo exceptions.\n\n=====================================================\nEMPLOYEE MODULE\n=====================================================\n\nCRUD\n\nPagination\n\nSearch\n\nFilters\n\nSoft Delete\n\nRestore\n\nImport Excel\n\nExport Excel\n\nProfile Image\n\nDocuments\n\nSalary\n\nBank Details\n\nEmergency Contact\n\nReporting Manager\n\n=====================================================\nATTENDANCE\n=====================================================\n\nGeofence\n\nGPS\n\nPunch In\n\nPunch Out\n\nBreak\n\nShift\n\nLate\n\nOvertime\n\n=====================================================\nLEAVE\n=====================================================\n\nLeave Types\n\nApproval Workflow\n\nLeave Balance\n\nHoliday Calendar\n\n=====================================================\nPAYROLL\n=====================================================\n\nSalary\n\nPF\n\nESI\n\nTDS\n\nPayslips\n\nBonuses\n\n=====================================================\nPROJECTS\n=====================================================\n\nTasks\n\nMembers\n\nDeadlines\n\nProgress\n\n=====================================================\nEXPENSES\n=====================================================\n\nClaims\n\nCategories\n\nApprovals\n\nReceipts\n\n=====================================================\nNOTIFICATIONS\n=====================================================\n\nDatabase Notifications\n\nPush Notifications\n\nRead\n\nUnread\n\n=====================================================\nANNOUNCEMENTS\n=====================================================\n\nDatabase Driven\n\nRich Text\n\nPinned\n\n=====================================================\nSECURITY\n=====================================================\n\nHelmet\n\nRate Limiting\n\nValidation\n\nParameterized SQL\n\nNever use string concatenation.\n\n=====================================================\nRULES\n=====================================================\n\nNever use\n\nmockData\n\ndummyData\n\ndatabase.json\n\nhardcoded arrays\n\ntemporary objects\n\nfallback demo data\n\nNever create duplicate repositories.\n\nNever create duplicate services.\n\nNever create duplicate controllers.\n\nNever modify unrelated files.\n\n=====================================================\nCODE QUALITY\n=====================================================\n\nEvery file under 300 lines.\n\nExtract reusable components.\n\nNo repeated code.\n\nStrict TypeScript.\n\n=====================================================\nOUTPUT\n=====================================================\n\nBuild module by module.\n\nFor every module create\n\nRepository\n\nService\n\nController\n\nRoutes\n\nTypes\n\nValidation\n\nFrontend API Service\n\nFrontend Components\n\nDatabase Schema\n\nSeed Script\n\nTesting Instructions\n\n=====================================================\nGOAL\n=====================================================\n\nTHEIAKSHI ONE should become an enterprise HRMS comparable to\n\nGreytHR\n\nKeka\n\nZoho People\n\nDarwinbox\n\nTeamNest\n\nwithout any mock data.\n\nEverything must be production ready."
    items {
      text: "You are a Principal Software Architect, Senior Backend Engineer, Senior Frontend Engineer, DevOps Engineer, Database Architect, and UI/UX Engineer.\n\nYour task is to build THEIAKSHI ONE Enterprise HRMS from scratch.\n\nThis is NOT a demo project.\n\nIt must be production-ready.\n\n=====================================================\nPROJECT NAME\n=====================================================\n\nTHEIAKSHI ONE Enterprise HRMS\n\nCompany\n\nTHEIAKSHI ENTERPRISES\n\n=====================================================\nTECH STACK\n=====================================================\n\nFrontend\n---------\nReact 19\nTypeScript\nVite\nMaterial UI\nReact Query (TanStack)\nReact Hook Form\nReact Router\nAxios\nZod\n\nBackend\n---------\nNode.js\nExpress\nTypeScript\n\nDatabase\n---------\nPostgreSQL\nNeon Database\n\nAuthentication\n---------\nJWT\nRefresh Tokens\nbcrypt\n\nStorage\n---------\nCloudinary (documents/images)\n\nNotifications\n---------\nFirebase Cloud Messaging\n\nRealtime\n---------\nSocket.io\n\nCharts\n---------\nRecharts\n\nDeployment\n---------\nFrontend \342\206\222 Render\n\nBackend \342\206\222 Render\n\nDatabase \342\206\222 Neon\n\n=====================================================\nARCHITECTURE\n=====================================================\n\nUse proper enterprise architecture.\n\nbackend\n\nsrc\n\ncontrollers\n\nservices\n\nrepositories\n\nroutes\n\nmiddlewares\n\ndatabase\n\nconfig\n\ntypes\n\nutils\n\nvalidators\n\nfrontend\n\nsrc\n\ncomponents\n\npages\n\nhooks\n\nservices\n\ncontexts\n\nlayouts\n\nroutes\n\nutils\n\ntypes\n\nEvery API must follow\n\nController\n\n\342\206\223\n\nService\n\n\342\206\223\n\nRepository\n\n\342\206\223\n\nPostgreSQL\n\nNo SQL inside controllers.\n\nNo SQL inside React.\n\n=====================================================\nDATABASE\n=====================================================\n\nNO JSON\n\nNO LOCAL STORAGE\n\nNO MOCK DATA\n\nNO DATABASE.JSON\n\nEverything must co