    thinking: "**Assessing Skill Sets**\n\nI\'m evaluating our skill sets and current environment to ensure we can build \"THEIAKSHI ONE Enterprise HRMS.\" While PostgreSQL/Neon are mentioned, the user also references Cloud SQL. I\'m focusing on the best path forward given these considerations. I\'m checking if Cloud SQL support is useful.\n\n\n**Reviewing Infrastructure Options**\n\nI\'m now diving into infrastructure options, specifically assessing the relevance of a Cloud SQL setup skill versus an embedded database within the Node.js server. The user requested PostgreSQL/Neon, and port 3000 is available, so I am weighing the merits of using `pg-mem`, SQLite, or an in-process PostgreSQL database. I\'m focusing on environment constraints and available packages to determine the best approach.\n\n\n**Listing Required Skills**\n\nI\'ve completed an inventory of the skills needed for this project. They include `cloudsql-execute-sql`, `cloudsql-setup`, `cloudsql-update-schema`, `firebase-integration`, `focus-mode`, and `gemini-api`, given the requirements of PostgreSQL integration, AI insights via Gemini, and other requested features. I am focusing on matching these capabilities to the architecture.\n\n\n"
