optimizing for efficient retrieval.\n\n\n**Structuring Backend Implementation**\n\nI\'m now detailing the directory structure, organizing backend components as requested, including database initialization, schema definition, and comprehensive seed data for the entity. I\'m focusing on repositories, services, controllers, and routes. I\'m building out endpoints, ensuring each endpoint returns a consistent `{ success: boolean, message: string, data: any }` structure, to facilitate frontend integration.\n\n\n"
