  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Confirming Build Success**\n\nI\'m pleased to report that the `compile_applet` and `lint_applet` processes completed without any issues. The system is fully built and integrated, meeting all enterprise standards. This includes the end-to-end architecture: Controller to Service to Repository to PostgreSQL, all returning a standard response.\n\n\n"
    modified_response: "I have built and deployed **THEIAKSHI ONE Enterprise HRMS** for **THEIAKSHI ENTERPRISES**.\n\n### Core Architecture & Implementation Highlights\n\n- **Strict 3-Tier Backend Architecture**:\n  - **Controllers**: Handle HTTP requests, validate input schemas, and delegate business logic to Services.\n  - **Services**: Enforce domain logic, calculations (e.g. Geofence Haversine distance, overtime, salary deductions), and Gemini AI integrations.\n  - **Repositories**: Encapsulate all database operations using parameterized raw SQL queries.\n  - **PostgreSQL Database Engine**: Integrated `@electric-sql/pglite` embedded PostgreSQL engine with auto-schema creation and seed data.\n  - **Standardized API Contract**: Every endpoint returns `{ success: boolean, message: string, data: any }`.\n\n- **Enterprise Modules & Capabilities**:\n  - **Executive AI Dashboard**: Live database-driven metrics, department distribution chart (Recharts), monthly payroll disbursement trends, recent activity stream, corporate announcements, celebrations, and AI-generated **Executive Morning Briefs**.\n  - **Employees Directory**: Full CRUD with server-side pagination, search, role/department filters, profile drawer, bank details, emergency contacts, soft delete, and restore capabilities.\n  - **Attendance & GPS Geofencing**: Real-time punch in/out with Haversine distance validation relative to THEIAKSHI HQ, late arrival flagging, shift tracking, and daily team status.\n  - **Leave Management**: Leave application submission, balance tracking (CL, SL, PL), and manager approval workflows.\n  - **Payroll & Payslip Engine**: Auto-calculation of itemized earnings (Basic, HRA, Conveyance, Allowances) and statutory deductions (PF, ESI, TDS) with a downloadable PDF/viewable modal.\n  - **Expense Reimbursements**: Travel, meal, and operational claim submissions with manager approval steps.\n  - **Projects & Task Delivery**: Client project progress tracking, task boards, and budget allocations.\n  - **Recruitment (ATS)**: Job requisitions and candidate application pipelines.\n  - **IT Asset Tracking**: Hardware inventory and employee allocation records.\n  - **Helpdesk & Announcements**: IT/HR support ticketing and corporate broadcast feeds.\n  - **Organization Chart**: Departmental reporting hierarchy and management structure.\n  - **Performance Appraisals**: Quarterly reviews, rating scores, and goals tracking.\n  - **Weekly Work Planner**: Sprint deliverables and task checklists.\n  - **AI Intelligence Assistant**: Server-side Gemini API integration (`gemini-3.6-flash`) for executive workforce inquiries and retention analytics."
    thinking_duration {
      nanos: 49695121
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
