    user_response: "Apply the \"Geometric Balance\" design theme to the app.\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_START]\nDesign name: Geometric Balance\nDesign HTML:                   <!doctype html>\\n                  <html style=\\\"height: 100%; margin: 0;\\\">\\n                    <head>\\n                      <meta charset=\\\"UTF-8\\\" />\\n                      <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\\\" />\\n                      <script src=\\\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@tailwindcss/browser@4\\\"></script>\\n                      <link href=\\\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Material+Symbols+Outlined:opsz,wght,FILL,GRAD@20..48,100..700,0..1,-50..200\\\" rel=\\\"stylesheet\\\" />\\n                      <style>\\n                        body { margin: 0; height: 100%; display: flex; flex-direction: column; overflow: hidden; }\\n                        /* Fallback classes in case Tailwind fails to load in sandbox */\\n                        .h-full { height: 100%; }\\n                        .w-full { width: 100%; }\\n                        .flex { display: flex; }\\n                        .flex-col { flex-direction: column; }\\n                        .flex-1 { flex: 1 1 0%; }\\n                      </style>\\n                    </head>\\n                    <body>\\n                      <div class=\\\"flex h-[768px] w-[1024px] bg-[#F8FAFC] font-sans overflow-hidden text-slate-900\\\">\\n  <!-- Left Sidebar -->\\n  <aside class=\\\"w-64 bg-[#0F172A] flex flex-col border-r border-slate-200\\\">\\n    <div class=\\\"p-6 flex items-center gap-3\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"w-8 h-8 bg-blue-600 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-white\\\">T1</div>\\n      <div class=\\\"leading-none\\\">\\n        <h1 class=\\\"text-white font-bold text-sm tracking-tight\\\">THEIAKSHI ONE</h1>\\n        <p class=\\\"text-slate-400 text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest mt-1\\\">Enterprise HRMS</p>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n\\n    <nav class=\\\"flex-1 px-4 space-y-1 mt-4\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"flex items-center gap-3 bg-blue-600/10 text-blue-400 p-2.5 rounded-lg text-sm font-medium border border-blue-600/20\\\">\\n        <svg class=\\\"w-5 h-5\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\"><path stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\" d=\\\"M4 6a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2v2a2 2 0 01-2 2H6a2 2 0 01-2-2V6zM14 6a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2v2a2 2 0 01-2 2h-2a2 2 0 01-2-2V6zM4 16a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2v2a2 2 0 01-2 2H6a2 2 0 01-2-2v-2zM14 16a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2v2a2 2 0 01-2 2h-2a2 2 0 01-2-2v-2z\\\"/></svg>\\n        Dashboard\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"flex items-center gap-3 text-slate-400 hover:text-white hover:bg-slate-800 p-2.5 rounded-lg text-sm font-medium transition-colors\\\">\\n        <svg class=\\\"w-5 h-5\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\"><path stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\" d=\\\"M12 4.354a4 4 0 110 5.292M15 21H3v-1a6 6 0 0112 0v1zm0 0h6v-1a6 6 0 00-9-5.197M13 7a4 4 0 11-8 0 4 4 0 018 0z\\\"/></svg>\\n        Employees\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"flex items-center gap-3 text-slate-400 hover:text-white hover:bg-slate-800 p-2.5 rounded-lg text-sm font-medium transition-colors\\\">\\n        <svg class=\\\"w-5 h-5\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\"><path stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\" d=\\\"M8 7V3m8 4V3m-9 8h10M5 21h14a2 2 0 002-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v12a2 2 0 002 2z\\\"/></svg>\\n        Attendance\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"flex items-center gap-3 text-slate-400 hover:text-white hover:bg-slate-800 p-2.5 rounded-lg text-sm font-medium transition-colors\\\">\\n        <svg class=\\\"w-5 h-5\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\"><path stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\" d=\\\"M17 9V7a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v6a2 2 0 002 2h2m2 4h10a2 2 0 002-2v-6a2 2 0 00-2-2H9a2 2 0 00-2 2v6a2 2 0 002 2zm7-5a2 2 0 11-4 0 2 2 0 014 0z\\\"/></svg>\\n        Payroll\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"flex items-center gap-3 text-slate-400 hover:text-white hover:bg-slate-800 p-2.5 rounded-lg text-sm font-medium transition-colors\\\">\\n        <svg class=\\\"w-5 h-5\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\"><path stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\" d=\\\"M9 5H7a2 2 0 00-2 2v12a2 2 0 002 2h10a2 2 0 002-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2h-2M9 5a2 2 0 002 2h2a2 2 0 002-2M9 5a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2m-3 7h3m-3 4h3m-6-4h.01M9 16h.01\\\"/></svg>\\n        Projects\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"flex items-center gap-3 text-indigo-400 hover:text-indigo-300 hover:bg-indigo-900/20 p-2.5 rounded-lg text-sm font-bold transition-colors border border-indigo-500/20 mt-4\\\">\\n        <svg class=\\\"w-5 h-5\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\"><path stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\" d=\\\"M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z\\\"/></svg>\\n        AI Assistant\\n      </div>\\n    </nav>\\n\\n    <div class=\\\"p-4 mt-auto border-t border-slate-800\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"flex items-center gap-3\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-slate-700 flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-bold text-white\\\">JD</div>\\n        <div>\\n          <p class=\\\"text-xs font-semibold text-white\\\">John Doe</p>\\n          <p class=\\\"text-[10px] text-slate-400\\\">Administrator</p>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n  </aside>\\n\\n  <!-- Main Content Area -->\\n  <main class=\\\"flex-1 flex flex-col h-full bg-[#F1F5F9]\\\">\\n    <!-- Top Header -->\\n    <header class=\\\"h-16 bg-white border-b border-slate-200 flex items-center justify-between px-8\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"flex items-center gap-4 flex-1\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"relative w-96\\\">\\n          <input type=\\\"text\\\" placeholder=\\\"Search employees, tasks, documents...\\\" class=\\\"w-full pl-10 pr-4 py-2 bg-slate-100 border-none rounded-md text-sm focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-500 outline-none\\\" />\\n          <svg class=\\\"w-4 h-4 text-slate-400 absolute left-3 top-2.5\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\"><path stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\" d=\\\"M21 21l-6-6m2-5a7 7 0 11-14 0 7 7 0 0114 0z\\\"/></svg>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"flex items-center gap-6\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"flex items-center gap-2 text-slate-600\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-green-500 animate-pulse\\\"></div>\\n          <span class=\\\"text-xs font-medium\\\">DB Sync: Online</span>\\n        </div>\\n        <button class=\\\"relative\\\">\\n          <svg class=\\\"w-6 h-6 text-slate-400\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\"><path stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\" d=\\\"M15 17h5l-1.405-1.405A2.032 2.032 0 0118 14.158V11a6.002 6.002 0 00-4-5.659V5a2 2 0 10-4 0v.341C7.67 6.165 6 8.388 6 11v3.159c0 .538-.214 1.055-.595 1.436L4 17h5m6 0v1a3 3 0 11-6 0v-1m6 0H9\\\"/></svg>\\n          <span class=\\\"absolute -top-1 -right-1 w-4 h-4 bg-red-500 text-[10px] text-white flex items-center justify-center rounded-full border-2 border-white\\\">4</span>\\n        </button>\\n      </div>\\n    </header>\\n\\n    <!-- Dashboard Grid -->\\n    <section class=\\\"p-8 flex-1 grid grid-cols-12 grid-rows-6 gap-6\\\">\\n      <!-- Top Metric Cards -->\\n      <div class=\\\"col-span-3 row-span-1 bg-white p-5 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm flex flex-col justify-between\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"flex justify-between items-start\\\">\\n          <p class=\\\"text-xs font-bold text-slate-500 uppercase tracking-tight\\\">Total Employees</p>\\n          <span class=\\\"text-[10px] px-2 py-0.5 bg-blue-100 text-blue-700 rounded-full font-bold\\\">+12.5%</span>\\n        </div>\\n        <p class=\\\"text-3xl font-black text-slate-900\\\">1,428</p>\\n      </div>\\n      \\n      <div class=\\\"col-span-3 row-span-1 bg-white p-5 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm flex flex-col justify-between\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"flex justify-between items-start\\\">\\n          <p class=\\\"text-xs font-bold text-slate-500 uppercase tracking-tight\\\">Attendance Today</p>\\n          <span class=\\\"text-[10px] px-2 py-0.5 bg-green-100 text-green-700 rounded-full font-bold\\\">98.2%</span>\\n        </div>\\n        <p class=\\\"text-3xl font-black text-slate-900\\\">1,402</p>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <div class=\\\"col-span-3 row-span-1 bg-white p-5 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm flex flex-col justify-between\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"flex justify-between items-start\\\">\\n          <p class=\\\"text-xs font-bold text-slate-500 uppercase tracking-tight\\\">Pending Leaves</p>\\n          <span class=\\\"text-[10px] px-2 py-0.5 bg-orange-100 text-orange-700 rounded-full font-bold\\\">Action Required</span>\\n        </div>\\n        <p class=\\\"text-3xl font-black text-slate-900\\\">24</p>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <div class=\\\"col-span-3 row-span-1 bg-white p-5 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm flex flex-col justify-between\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"flex justify-between items-start\\\">\\n          <p class=\\\"text-xs font-bold text-slate-500 uppercase tracking-tight\\\">Payroll Cycle</p>\\n          <span class=\\\"text-[10px] px-2 py-0.5 bg-slate-100 text-slate-700 rounded-full font-bold\\\">Day 24/30</span>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"w-full bg-slate-200 h-2 rounded-full mt-2 overflow-hidden\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"bg-blue-600 h-full w-4/5\\\"></div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <!-- Main Charts Section -->\\n      <div class=\\\"col-span-8 row-span-3 bg-white rounded-xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm p-6 flex flex-col\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"flex items-center justify-between mb-6\\\">\\n          <h2 class=\\\"text-lg font-bold text-slate-800\\\">Workforce Productivity Trends</h2>\\n          <div class=\\\"flex gap-2\\\">\\n            <button class=\\\"px-3 py-1 bg-slate-100 text-xs font-bold rounded-md border border-slate-200\\\">Weekly</button>\\n            <button class=\\\"px-3 py-1 bg-blue-600 text-white text-xs font-bold rounded-md\\\">Monthly</button>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n        <!-- Mock Chart Visualization -->\\n        <div class=\\\"flex-1 flex items-end justify-between gap-4 px-4 pb-4 border-b border-slate-100\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"w-12 bg-blue-100 h-[60%] rounded-t-md relative group\\\"><div class=\\\"absolute -top-6 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 text-[10px] font-bold bg-slate-800 text-white px-1 rounded\\\">82%</div></div>\\n          <div class=\\\"w-12 bg-blue-200 h-[45%] rounded-t-md\\\"></div>\\n          <div class=\\\"w-12 bg-blue-300 h-[75%] rounded-t-md\\\"></div>\\n          <div class=\\\"w-12 bg-blue-400 h-[30%] rounded-t-md\\\"></div>\\n          <div class=\\\"w-12 bg-blue-500 h-[90%] rounded-t-md\\\"></div>\\n          <div class=\\\"w-12 bg-blue-600 h-[65%] rounded-t-md\\\"></div>\\n          <div class=\\\"w-12 bg-blue-700 h-[80%] rounded-t-md\\\"></div>\\n          <div class=\\\"w-12 bg-blue-400 h-[50%] rounded-t-md\\\"></div>\\n          <div class=\\\"w-12 bg-blue-500 h-[70%] rounded-t-md\\\"></div>\\n          <div class=\\\"w-12 bg-blue-600 h-[85%] rounded-t-md\\\"></div>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"flex items-center gap-12 mt-4\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"flex items-center gap-2\\\">\\n            <div class=\\\"w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-blue-600\\\"></div>\\n            <span class=\\\"text-xs text-slate-500 font-medium\\\">Completed Tasks</span>\\n          </div>\\n          <div class=\\\"flex items-center gap-2\\\">\\n            <div class=\\\"w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-blue-200\\\"></div>\\n            <span class=\\\"text-xs text-slate-500 font-medium\\\">Attendance Rate</span>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <!-- AI Insights Widget -->\\n      <div class=\\\"col-span-4 row-span-3 bg-gradient-to-br from-indigo-900 to-slate-900 rounded-xl shadow-lg p-6 text-white overflow-hidden relative border border-slate-800\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"absolute top-0 right-0 w-32 h-32 bg-indigo-500/10 rounded-full -translate-y-1/2 translate-x-1/2 blur-2xl\\\"></div>\\n        <div class=\\\"flex items-center gap-3 mb-4\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"w-8 h-8 bg-indigo-500 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center\\\">\\n            <svg class=\\\"w-5 h-5\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\"><path stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\" d=\\\"M9.663 17h4.673M12 3v1m6.364 1.636l-.707.707M21 12h-1M4 12H3m3.343-5.657l-.707-.707m2.828 9.9a5 5 0 117.072 0l-.548.547A3.374 3.374 0 0014 18.469V19a2 2 0 11-4 0v-.531c0-.895-.356-1.754-.988-2.386l-.548-.547z\\\"/></svg>\\n          </div>\\n          <h3 class=\\\"font-bold text-sm uppercase tracking-widest text-indigo-300\\\">AI Performance Insight</h3>\\n        </div>\\n        <p class=\\\"text-lg font-light leading-relaxed mb-4 italic\\\">\\n          \\\"Predictive analysis suggests a <span class=\\\"text-indigo-300 font-bold underline underline-offset-4\\\">14% risk of attrition</span> in the Engineering department within the next quarter based on project overtime trends.\\\"\\n        </p>\\n        <button class=\\\"w-full py-2 bg-indigo-500 hover:bg-indigo-400 rounded-lg text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest transition-all\\\">View Recommendation</button>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <!-- Bottom Table Content -->\\n      <div class=\\\"col-span-12 row-span-2 bg-white rounded-xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm flex flex-col overflow-hidden\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"px-6 py-4 border-b border-slate-100 flex justify-between items-center\\\">\\n          <h2 class=\\\"text-sm font-bold text-slate-800 uppercase tracking-widest\\\">Recent Recruitment Activity</h2>\\n          <button class=\\\"text-blue-600 text-xs font-bold\\\">View All Candidates</button>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"flex-1\\\">\\n          <table class=\\\"w-full border-collapse\\\">\\n            <thead>\\n              <tr class=\\\"bg-slate-50 border-b border-slate-100\\\">\\n                <th class=\\\"px-6 py-3 text-left text-[10px] font-black text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-widest\\\">Candidate</th>\\n                <th class=\\\"px-6 py-3 text-left text-[10px] font-black text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-widest\\\">Applied Role</th>\\n                <th class=\\\"px-6 py-3 text-left text-[10px] font-black text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-widest\\\">Department</th>\\n                <th class=\\\"px-6 py-3 text-left text-[10px] font-black text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-widest\\\">Status</th>\\n                <th class=\\\"px-6 py-3 text-left text-[10px] font-black text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-widest\\\">Interview Date</th>\\n              </tr>\\n            </thead>\\n            <tbody class=\\\"text-xs text-slate-600\\\">\\n              <tr class=\\\"border-b border-slate-50\\\">\\n                <td class=\\\"px-6 py-3 font-semibold text-slate-900\\\">Sarah Williams</td>\\n                <td class=\\\"px-6 py-3\\\">Senior Frontend Engineer</td>\\n                <td class=\\\"px-6 py-3\\\">Technology</td>\\n                <td class=\\\"px-6 py-3\\\"><span class=\\\"px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-blue-100 text-blue-700 text-[10px] font-bold\\\">Technical Round</span></td>\\n                <td class=\\\"px-6 py-3 font-mono\\\">Oct 24, 2023</td>\\n              </tr>\\n              <tr>\\n                <td class=\\\"px-6 py-3 font-semibold text-slate-900\\\">Marcus Thorne</td>\\n                <td class=\\\"px-6 py-3\\\">Operations Manager</td>\\n                <td class=\\\"px-6 py-3\\\">Logistics</td>\\n                <td class=\\\"px-6 py-3\\\"><span class=\\\"px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-orange-100 text-orange-700 text-[10px] font-bold\\\">HR Review</span></td>\\n                <td class=\\\"px-6 py-3 font-mono\\\">Oct 25, 2023</td>\\n              </tr>\\n            </tbody>\\n          </table>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <!-- Bottom Status Bar -->\\n    <footer class=\\\"h-8 bg-white border-t border-slate-200 px-6 flex items-center justify-between text-[10px] font-medium text-slate-400\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"flex gap-4\\\">\\n        <span>THEIAKSHI ENTERPRISES</span>\\n        <span class=\\\"text-slate-200\\\">|</span>\\n        <span>v1.0.4-enterprise</span>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"flex gap-4\\\">\\n        <span class=\\\"flex items-center gap-1\\\"><div class=\\\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-green-500\\\"></div> Postgres Neon Cluster Active</span>\\n        <span class=\\\"flex items-center gap-1\\\"><div class=\\\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-green-500\\\"></div> Render Deployment Healthy</span>\\n      </div>\\n    </footer>\\n  </main>\\n</div>\\n                    </body>\\n                  </html>\nDesign instructions: Extract ONLY the styling (colors, fonts, spacing, borders, shadows, backgrounds, gradients) and layout patterns (flexbox/grid structure, component arrangement) from the Design HTML above. Do NOT replace or restructure the existing app\'s HTML elements \342\200\224 preserve all existing components, content, and functionality. Only modify CSS/styling and adjust layout containers as needed to match the theme\'s aesthetic. You MUST execute file editing or creation tool calls (such as edit_file, multi_edit_file, or create_file) to apply styling updates to target files directly. Do NOT output code blocks, HTML, or TSX directly in your text chat response.\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_END]"
    items {
      text: "Apply the \"Geometric Balance\" design theme to the app.\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_START]\nDesign name: Geometric Balance\nDesign HTML:                   <!doctype html>\\n                  <html style=\\\"height: 100%; margin: 0;\\\">\\n                    <head>\\n                      <meta charset=\\\"UTF-8\\\" />\\n                      <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\\\" />\\n                      <script src=\\\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@tailwindcss/browser@4\\\"></script>\\n                      <link href=\\\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Material+Symbols+Outlined:opsz,wght,FILL,GRAD@20..48,100..700,0..1,-50..200\\\" rel=\\\"stylesheet\\\" />\\n                      <style>\\n                        body { margin: 0; height: 100%; display: flex; flex-direction: column; overflow: hidden; }\\n                        /* Fallback classes in case Tailwind fails to load in sandbox */\\n                        .h-full { height: 100%; }\\n                        .w-full { width: 100%; }\\n                        .flex { display: flex; }\\n                        .flex-col { flex-direction: column; }\\n                        .flex-1 { flex: 1 1 0%; }\\n                      </style>\\n                    </head>\\n                    <body>\\n                      <div class=\\\"flex h-[768px] w-[1024px] bg-[#F8FAFC] font-sans overflow-hidden text-slate-900\\\">\\n  <!-- Left Sidebar -->\\n  <aside class=\\\"w-64 bg-[#0F172A] flex flex-col border-r border-slate-200\\\">\\n    <div class=\\\"p-6 flex items-center gap-3\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"w-8 h-8 bg-blue-600 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-white\\\">T1</div>\\n      <div class=\\\"leading-none\\\">\\n        <h1 class=\\\"text-white font-bold text-sm tracking-tight\\\">THEIAKSHI ONE</h1>\\n        <p class=\\\"text-slate-400 text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest mt-1\\\">Enterprise HRMS</p>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n\\n    <nav class=\\\"flex-1 px-4 space-y-1 mt-4\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"flex items-center gap-3 bg-blue-600/10 text-blue-400 p-2.5 rounded-lg text-sm font-medium border border-blue-600/20\\\">\\n        <svg class=\\\"w-5 h-5\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\"><path stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\" d=\\\"M4 6a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2v2a2 2 0 01-2 2H6a2 2 0 01-2-2V6zM14 6a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2v2a2 2 0 01-2 2h-2a2 2 0 01-2-2V6zM4 16a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2v2a2 2 0 01-2 2H6a2 2 0 01-2-2v-2zM14 16a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2v2a2 2 0 01-2 2h-2a2 2 0 01-2-2v-2z\\\"/></svg>\\n        Dashboard\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"flex items-center gap-3 text-slate-400 hover:text-white hover:bg-slate-800 p-2.5 rounded-lg text-sm font-medium transition-colors\\\">\\n        <svg class=\\\"w-5 h-5\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\"><path stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\" d=\\\"M12 4.354a4 4 0 110 5.292M15 21H3v-1a6 6 0 0112 0v1zm0 0h6v-1a6 6 0 00-9-5.197M13 7a4 4 0 11-8 0 4 4 0 018 0z\\\"/></svg>\\n        Employees\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"flex items-center gap-3 text-slate-400 hover:text-white hover:bg-slate-800 p-2.5 rounded-lg text-sm font-medium transition-colors\\\">\\n        <svg class=\\\"w-5 h-5\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\"><path stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\" d=\\\"M8 7V3m8 4V3m-9 8h10M5 21h14a2 2 0 002-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v12a2 2 0 002 2z\\\"/></svg>\\n        Attendance\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"flex items-center gap-3 text-slate-400 hover:text-white hover:bg-slate-800 p-2.5 rounded-lg text-sm font-medium transition-colors\\\">\\n        <svg class=\\\"w-5 h-5\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\"><path stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\" d=\\\"M17 9V7a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v6a2 2 0 002 2h2m2 4h10a2 2 0 002-2v-6a2 2 0 00-2-2H9a2 2 0 00-2 2v6a2 2 0 002 2zm7-5a2 2 0 11-4 0 2 2 0 014 0z\\\"/></svg>\\n        Payroll\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"flex items-center gap-3 text-slate-400 hover:text-white hover:bg-slate-800 p-2.5 rounded-lg text-sm font-medium transition-colors\\\">\\n        <svg class=\\\"w-5 h-5\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\"><path stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\" d=\\\"M9 5H7a2 2 0 00-2 2v12a2 2 0 002 2h10a2 2 0 002-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2h-2M9 5a2 2 0 002 2h2a2 2 0 002-2M9 5a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2m-3 7h3m-3 4h3m-6-4h.01M9 16h.01\\\"/></svg>\\n        Projects\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"flex items-center gap-3 text-indigo-400 hover:text-indigo-300 hover:bg-indigo-900/20 p-2.5 rounded-lg text-sm font-bold transition-colors border border-indigo-500/20 mt-4\\\">\\n        <svg class=\\\"w-5 h-5\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\"><path stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\" d=\\\"M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z\\\"/></svg>\\n        AI Assistant\\n      </div>\\n    </nav>\\n\\n    <div class=\\\"p-4 mt-auto border-t border-slate-800\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"flex items-center gap-3\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-slate-700 flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-bold text-white\\\">JD</div>\\n        <div>\\n          <p class=\\\"text-xs font-semibold text-white\\\">John Doe</p>\\n          <p class=\\\"text-[10px] text-slate-400\\\">Administrator</p>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n  </aside>\\n\\n  <!-- Main Content Area -->\\n  <main class=\\\"flex-1 flex flex-col h-full bg-[#F1F5F9]\\\">\\n    <!-- Top Header -->\\n    <header class=\\\"h-16 bg-white border-b border-slate-200 flex items-center justify-between px-8\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"flex items-center gap-4 flex-1\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"relative w-96\\\">\\n          <input type=\\\"text\\\" placeholder=\\\"Search employees, tasks, documents...\\\" class=\\\"w-full pl-10 pr-4 py-2 bg-slate-100 border-none rounded-md text-sm focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-500 outline-none\\\" />\\n          <svg class=\\\"w-4 h-4 text-slate-400 absolute left-3 top-2.5\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\"><path stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\" d=\\\"M21 21l-6-6m2-5a7 7 0 11-14 0 7 7 0 0114 0z\\\"/></svg>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"flex items-center gap-6\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"flex items-center gap-2 text-slate-600\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-green-500 animate-pulse\\\"></div>\\n          <span class=\\\"text-xs font-medium\\\">DB Sync: Online</span>\\n        </div>\\n        <button class=\\\"relative\\\">\\n          <svg class=\\\"w-6 h-6 text-slate-400\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\"><path stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\" d=\\\"M15 17h5l-1.405-1.405A2.032 2.032 0 0118 14.158V11a6.002 6.002 0 00-4-5.659V5a2 2 0 10-4 0v.341C7.67 6.165 6 8.388 6 11v3.159c0 .538-.214 1.055-.595 1.436L4 17h5m6 0v1a3 3 0 11-6 0v-1m6 0H9\\\"/></svg>\\n          <span class=\\\"absolute -top-1 -right-1 w-4 h-4 bg-red-500 text-[10px] text-white flex items-center justify-center rounded-full border-2 border-white\\\">4</span>\\n        </button>\\n      </div>\\n    </header>\\n\\n    <!-- Dashboard Grid -->\\n    <section class=\\\"p-8 flex-1 grid grid-cols-12 grid-rows-6 gap-6\\\">\\n      <!-- Top Metric Cards -->\\n      <div class=\\\"col-span-3 row-span-1 bg-white p-5 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm flex flex-col justify-between\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"flex justify-between items-start\\\">\\n          <p class=\\\"text-xs font-bold text-slate-500 uppercase tracking-tight\\\">Total Employees</p>\\n          <span class=\\\"text-[10px] px-2 py-0.5 bg-blue-100 text-blue-700 rounded-full font-bold\\\">+12.5%</span>\\n        </div>\\n        <p class=\\\"text-3xl font-black text-slate-900\\\">1,428</p>\\n      </div>\\n      \\n      <div class=\\\"col-span-3 row-span-1 bg-white p-5 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm flex flex-col justify-between\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"flex justify-between items-start\\\">\\n          <p class=\\\"text-xs font-bold text-slate-500 uppercase tracking-tight\\\">Attendance Today</p>\\n          <span class=\\\"text-[10px] px-2 py-0.5 bg-green-100 text-green-700 rounded-full font-bold\\\">98.2%</span>\\n        </div>\\n        <p class=\\\"text-3xl font-black text-slate-900\\\">1,402</p>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <div class=\\\"col-span-3 row-span-1 bg-white p-5 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm flex flex-col justify-between\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"flex justify-between items-start\\\">\\n          <p class=\\\"text-xs font-bold text-slate-500 uppercase tracking-tight\\\">Pending Leaves</p>\\n          <span class=\\\"text-[10px] px-2 py-0.5 bg-orange-100 text-orange-700 rounded-full font-bold\\\">Action Required</span>\\n        </div>\\n        <p class=\\\"text-3xl font-black text-slate-900\\\">24</p>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <div class=\\\"col-span-3 row-span-1 bg-white p-5 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm flex flex-col justify-between\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"flex justify-between items-start\\\">\\n          <p class=\\\"text-xs font-bold text-slate-500 uppercase tracking-tight\\\">Payroll Cycle</p>\\n          <span class=\\\"text-[10px] px-2 py-0.5 bg-slate-100 text-slate-700 rounded-full font-bold\\\">Day 24/30</span>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"w-full bg-slate-200 h-2 rounded-full mt-2 overflow-hidden\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"bg-blue-600 h-full w-4/5\\\"></div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <!-- Main Charts Section -->\\n      <div class=\\\"col-span-8 row-span-3 bg-white rounded-xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm p-6 flex flex-col\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"flex items-center justify-between mb-6\\\">\\n          <h2 class=\\\"text-lg font-bold text-slate-800\\\">Workforce Productivity Trends</h2>\\n          <div class=\\\"flex gap-2\\\">\\n            <button class=\\\"px-3 py-1 bg-slate-100 text-xs font-bold rounded-md border border-slate-200\\\">Weekly</button>\\n            <button class=\\\"px-3 py-1 bg-blue-600 text-white text-xs font-bold rounded-md\\\">Monthly</button>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n        <!-- Mock Chart Visualization -->\\n        <div class=\\\"flex-1 flex items-end justify-between gap-4 px-4 pb-4 border-b border-slate-100\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"w-12 bg-blue-100 h-[60%] rounded-t-md relative group\\\"><div class=\\\"absolute -top-6 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 text-[10px] font-bold bg-slate-800 text-white px-1 rounded\\\">82%</div></div>\\n          <div class=\\\"w-12 bg-blue-200 h-[45%] rounded-t-md\\\"></div>\\n          <div class=\\\"w-12 bg-blue-300 h-[75%] rounded-t-md\\\"></div>\\n          <div class=\\\"w-12 bg-blue-400 h-[30%] rounded-t-md\\\"></div>\\n          <div class=\\\"w-12 bg-blue-500 h-[90%] rounded-t-md\\\"></div>\\n          <div class=\\\"w-12 bg-blue-600 h-[65%] rounded-t-md\\\"></div>\\n          <div class=\\\"w-12 bg-blue-700 h-[80%] rounded-t-md\\\"></div>\\n          <div class=\\\"w-12 bg-blue-400 h-[50%] rounded-t-md\\\"></div>\\n          <div class=\\\"w-12 bg-blue-500 h-[70%] rounded-t-md\\\"></div>\\n          <div class=\\\"w-12 bg-blue-600 h-[85%] rounded-t-md\\\"></div>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"flex items-center gap-12 mt-4\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"flex items-center gap-2\\\">\\n            <div class=\\\"w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-blue-600\\\"></div>\\n            <span class=\\\"text-xs text-slate-500 font-medium\\\">Completed Tasks</span>\\n          </div>\\n          <div class=\\\"flex items-center gap-2\\\">\\n            <div class=\\\"w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-blue-200\\\"></div>\\n            <span class=\\\"text-xs text-slate-500 font-medium\\\">Attendance Rate</span>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <!-- AI Insights Widget -->\\n      <div class=\\\"col-span-4 row-span-3 bg-gradient-to-br from-indigo-900 to-slate-900 rounded-xl shadow-lg p-6 text-white overflow-hidden relative border border-slate-800\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"absolute top-0 right-0 w-32 h-32 bg-indigo-500/10 rounded-full -translate-y-1/2 translate-x-1/2 blur-2xl\\\"></div>\\n        <div class=\\\"flex items-center gap-3 mb-4\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"w-8 h-8 bg-indigo-500 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center\\\">\\n            <svg class=\\\"w-5 h-5\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\"><path stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\" d=\\\"M9.663 17h4.673M12 3v1m6.364 1.636l-.707.707M21 12h-1M4 12H3m3.343-5.657l-.707-.707m2.828 9.9a5 5 0 117.072 0l-.548.547A3.374 3.374 0 0014 18.469V19a2 2 0 11-4 0v-.531c0-.895-.356-1.754-.988-2.386l-.548-.547z\\\"/></svg>\\n          </div>\\n          <h3 class=\\\"font-bold text-sm uppercase tracking-widest text-indigo-300\\\">AI Performance Insight</h3>\\n        </div>\\n        <p class=\\\"text-lg font-light leading-relaxed mb-4 italic\\\">\\n          \\\"Predictive analysis suggests a <span class=\\\"text-indigo-300 font-bold underline underline-offset-4\\\">14% risk of attrition</span> in the Engineering department within the next quarter based on project overtime trends.\\\"\\n        </p>\\n        <button class=\\\"w-full py-2 bg-indigo-500 hover:bg-indigo-400 rounded-lg text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest transition-all\\\">View Recommendation</button>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <!-- Bottom Table Content -->\\n      <div class=\\\"col-span-12 row-span-2 bg-white rounded-xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm flex flex-col overflow-hidden\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"px-6 py-4 border-b border-slate-100 flex justify-between items-center\\\">\\n          <h2 class=\\\"text-sm font-bold text-slate-800 uppercase tracking-widest\\\">Recent Recruitment Activity</h2>\\n          <button class=\\\"text-blue-600 text-xs font-bold\\\">View All Candidates</button>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"flex-1\\\">\\n          <table class=\\\"w-full border-collapse\\\">\\n            <thead>\\n              <tr class=\\\"bg-slate-50 border-b border-slate-100\\\">\\n                <th class=\\\"px-6 py-3 text-left text-[10px] font-black text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-widest\\\">Candidate</th>\\n                <th class=\\\"px-6 py-3 text-left text-[10px] font-black text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-widest\\\">Applied Role</th>\\n                <th class=\\\"px-6 py-3 text-left text-[10px] font-black text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-widest\\\">Department</th>\\n                <th class=\\\"px-6 py-3 text-left text-[10px] font-black text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-widest\\\">Status</th>\\n                <th class=\\\"px-6 py-3 text-left text-[10px] font-black text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-widest\\\">Interview Date</th>\\n              </tr>\\n            </thead>\\n            <tbody class=\\\"text-xs text-slate-600\\\">\\n              <tr class=\\\"border-b border-slate-50\\\">\\n                <td class=\\\"px-6 py-3 font-semibold text-slate-900\\\">Sarah Williams</td>\\n                <td class=\\\"px-6 py-3\\\">Senior Frontend Engineer</td>\\n                <td class=\\\"px-6 py-3\\\">Technology</td>\\n                <td class=\\\"px-6 py-3\\\"><span class=\\\"px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-blue-100 text-blue-700 text-[10px] font-bold\\\">Technical Round</span></td>\\n                <td class=\\\"px-6 py-3 font-mono\\\">Oct 24, 2023</td>\\n              </tr>\\n              <tr>\\n                <td class=\\\"px-6 py-3 font-semibold text-slate-900\\\">Marcus Thorne</td>\\n                <td class=\\\"px-6 py-3\\\">Operations Manager</td>\\n                <td class=\\\"px-6 py-3\\\">Logistics</td>\\n                <td class=\\\"px-6 py-3\\\"><span class=\\\"px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-orange-100 text-orange-700 text-[10px] font-bold\\\">HR Review</span></td>\\n                <td class=\\\"px-6 py-3 font-mono\\\">Oct 25, 2023</td>\\n              </tr>\\n            </tbody>\\n          </table>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <!-- Bottom Status Bar -->\\n    <footer class=\\\"h-8 bg-white border-t border-slate-200 px-6 flex items-center justify-between text-[10px] font-medium text-slate-400\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"flex gap-4\\\">\\n        <span>THEIAKSHI ENTERPRISES</span>\\n        <span class=\\\"text-slate-200\\\">|</span>\\n        <span>v1.0.4-enterprise</span>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"flex gap-4\\\">\\n        <span class=\\\"flex items-center gap-1\\\"><div class=\\\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-green-500\\\"></div> Postgres Neon Cluster Active</span>\\n        <span class=\\\"flex items-center gap-1\\\"><div class=\\\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-green-500\\\"></div> Render Deployment Healthy</span>\\n      </div>\\n    </footer>\\n  </main>\\n</div>\\n                    </body>\\n                  </html>\nDesign instructions: Extract ONLY the styling (colors, fonts, spacing, borders, shadows, backgrounds, gradients) and layout patterns (flexbox/grid structure, component arrangement) from the Design HTML above. Do NOT replace or restructure the existing app\'s HTML elements \342\200\224 preserve all existing components, content, and functionality. Only modify CSS/styling and adjust layout containers as needed to match the theme\'s aesthetic. You MUST execute file editing or creation tool calls (such as edit_file, multi_edit_file, or create_file) to apply styling updates to target files directly. Do NOT output code blocks, HTML, or TSX directly in your text chat response.\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_END]"
    }
  }
}
