  user_input {
    user_response: "You are now entering ARCHITECTURE LOCK MODE.\n\nThe project is THEIAKSHI ONE Enterprise HRMS.\n\nYour job is NOT to redesign the project.\n\nYour job is to refactor it into a production-grade enterprise architecture while preserving working functionality.\n\n=========================================================\nPRIMARY GOAL\n=========================================================\n\nBefore implementing any new feature:\n\n1. Analyze the entire project.\n2. Detect architectural problems.\n3. Detect duplicated code.\n4. Detect duplicated repositories.\n5. Detect duplicated services.\n6. Detect duplicated controllers.\n7. Detect duplicate database helpers.\n8. Detect mock data.\n9. Detect unused files.\n10. Detect dead code.\n11. Detect circular dependencies.\n12. Detect inconsistent API structures.\n\nDO NOT automatically fix them.\n\nGenerate a complete migration plan first.\n\n=========================================================\nDO NOT MODIFY\n=========================================================\n\nDo NOT modify unless explicitly instructed:\n\nserver.ts\n\npackage.json\n\nvite.config.ts\n\ntsconfig.json\n\nRender configuration\n\nNeon configuration\n\nEnvironment variables\n\nAuthentication flow\n\nExisting PostgreSQL connection\n\n=========================================================\nDATABASE\n=========================================================\n\nKeep Neon PostgreSQL.\n\nRemove\n\ndatabase.json\n\nmockData\n\ndummyData\n\ntemporary arrays\n\nlocal storage\n\nPGlite\n\nEmbedded databases\n\nEverything must use PostgreSQL.\n\n=========================================================\nBACKEND STRUCTURE\n=========================================================\n\nThe final structure MUST be\n\nbackend/src\n\nconfig\n\ndatabase\n\ncontrollers\n\nservices\n\nrepositories\n\nroutes\n\nmiddlewares\n\nvalidators\n\ntypes\n\nutils\n\nsocket\n\njobs\n\nevents\n\nstorage\n\nmail\n\nNo SQL in controllers.\n\nNo SQL in services.\n\nRepositories only perform SQL.\n\n=========================================================\nFRONTEND STRUCTURE\n=========================================================\n\nsrc\n\ncomponents\n\nmodules\n\npages\n\nhooks\n\nservices\n\ncontexts\n\nlayouts\n\nroutes\n\nutils\n\ntypes\n\ntheme\n\nEvery API call must be isolated inside services.\n\nReact components must never directly call PostgreSQL.\n\n=========================================================\nAPI STANDARD\n=========================================================\n\nEvery endpoint returns\n\n{\nsuccess,\nmessage,\ndata\n}\n\nNo exceptions.\n\n=========================================================\nFILE RULES\n=========================================================\n\nMaximum file length\n\n300 lines\n\nIf longer\n\nSplit into reusable files.\n\n=========================================================\nSTRICT RULES\n=========================================================\n\nNever create duplicate files.\n\nNever create wrapper files.\n\nNever rename working files unnecessarily.\n\nNever create another database helper.\n\nNever create another executeQuery implementation.\n\nNever create another postgres.ts.\n\nNever create another db.ts.\n\nUse the existing PostgreSQL layer.\n\n=========================================================\nMOCK DATA\n=========================================================\n\nFind every mock object.\n\nReplace them gradually.\n\nDo NOT replace everything at once.\n\nEvery replacement must preserve UI behaviour.\n\n=========================================================\nDELIVERABLE\n=========================================================\n\nDo NOT modify code yet.\n\nInstead generate a report.\n\nThe report must contain\n\n1. Folder structure analysis\n\n2. Duplicate files\n\n3. Duplicate logic\n\n4. Mock data locations\n\n5. Database problems\n\n6. API problems\n\n7. Security issues\n\n8. Performance issues\n\n9. Missing enterprise features\n\n10. Refactoring roadmap\n\n11. Estimated work in Sprints\n\nSprint 1\n\nSprint 2\n\nSprint 3\n\nSprint 4\n\nSprint 5\n\nDo not generate code.\n\nOnly generate the complete migration report."
    items {
      text: "You are now entering ARCHITECTURE LOCK MODE.\n\nThe project is THEIAKSHI ONE Enterprise HRMS.\n\nYour job is NOT to redesign the project.\n\nYour job is to refactor it into a production-grade enterprise architecture while preserving working functionality.\n\n=========================================================\nPRIMARY GOAL\n=========================================================\n\nBefore implementing any new feature:\n\n1. Analyze the entire project.\n2. Detect architectural problems.\n3. Detect duplicated code.\n4. Detect duplicated repositories.\n5. Detect duplicated services.\n6. Detect duplicated controllers.\n7. Detect duplicate database helpers.\n8. Detect mock data.\n9. Detect unused files.\n10. Detect dead code.\n11. Detect circular dependencies.\n12. Detect inconsistent API structures.\n\nDO NOT automatically fix them.\n\nGenerate a complete migration plan first.\n\n=========================================================\nDO NOT MODIFY\n=========================================================\n\nDo NOT modify unless explicitly instructed:\n\nserver.ts\n\npackage.json\n\nvite.config.ts\n\ntsconfig.json\n\nRender configuration\n\nNeon configuration\n\nEnvironment variables\n\nAuthentication flow\n\nExisting PostgreSQL connection\n\n=========================================================\nDATABASE\n=========================================================\n\nKeep Neon PostgreSQL.\n\nRemove\n\ndatabase.json\n\nmockData\n\ndummyData\n\ntemporary arrays\n\nlocal storage\n\nPGlite\n\nEmbedded databases\n\nEverything must use PostgreSQL.\n\n=========================================================\nBACKEND STRUCTURE\n=========================================================\n\nThe final structure MUST be\n\nbackend/src\n\nconfig\n\ndatabase\n\ncontrollers\n\nservices\n\nrepositories\n\nroutes\n\nmiddlewares\n\nvalidators\n\ntypes\n\nutils\n\nsocket\n\njobs\n\nevents\n\nstorage\n\nmail\n\nNo SQL in controllers.\n\nNo SQL in services.\n\nRepositories only perform SQL.\n\n=========================================================\nFRONTEND STRUCTURE\n=========================================================\n\nsrc\n\ncomponents\n\nmodules\n\npages\n\nhooks\n\nservices\n\ncontexts\n\nlayouts\n\nroutes\n\nutils\n\ntypes\n\ntheme\n\nEvery API call must be isolated inside services.\n\nReact components must never directly call PostgreSQL.\n\n=========================================================\nAPI STANDARD\n=========================================================\n\nEvery endpoint returns\n\n{\nsuccess,\nmessage,\ndata\n}\n\nNo exceptions.\n\n=========================================================\nFILE RULES\n=========================================================\n\nMaximum file length\n\n300 lines\n\nIf longer\n\nSplit into reusable files.\n\n=========================================================\nSTRICT RULES\n=========================================================\n\nNever create duplicate files.\n\nNever create wrapper files.\n\nNever rename working files unnecessarily.\n\nNever create another database helper.\n\nNever create another executeQuery implementation.\n\nNever create another postgres.ts.\n\nNever create another db.ts.\n\nUse the existing PostgreSQL layer.\n\n=========================================================\nMOCK DATA\n=========================================================\n\nFind every mock object.\n\nReplace them gradually.\n\nDo NOT replace everything at once.\n\nEvery replacement must preserve UI behaviour.\n\n=========================================================\nDELIVERABLE\n=========================================================\n\nDo NOT modify code yet.\n\nInstead generate a report.\n\nThe report must contain\n\n1. Folder structure analysis\n\n2. Duplicate files\n\n3. Duplicate logic\n\n4. Mock data locations\n\n5. Database problems\n\n6. API problems\n\n7. Security issues\n\n8. Performance issues\n\n9. Missing enterprise features\n\n10. Refactoring roadmap\n\n11. Estimated work in Sprints\n\nSprint 1\n\nSprint 2\n\nSprint 3\n\nSprint 4\n\nSprint 5\n\nDo not generate code.\n\nOnly generate the complete migration report."
