o not create another executeQuery().\n\nUse parameterized SQL only.\n\nNo string concatenation.\n\n=========================================================\nBACKEND\n=========================================================\n\nRepository\n\nOnly SQL.\n\nService\n\nBusiness rules.\n\nValidation.\n\nEmployee code generation.\n\nDuplicate checks.\n\nSalary calculations.\n\nController\n\nValidate request.\n\nCall service.\n\nReturn\n\n{\n  success,\n  message,\n  data\n}\n\nRoutes\n\nRouting only.\n\n=========================================================\nFRONTEND\n=========================================================\n\nCreate\n\nsrc/services/employeeService.ts\n\nEvery HTTP request must be inside this service.\n\nEmployeesPage.tsx\n\nmust not use\n\nfetch()\n\naxios()\n\ndirectly.\n\nUse employeeService only.\n\n=========================================================\nVALIDATION\n=========================================================\n\nValidate\n\nEmail\n\nPhone\n\nRole\n\nDepartment\n\nSalary\n\nRequired fields\n\nDuplicate email\n\nDuplicate employee code\n\n=========================================================\nTESTING\n=========================================================\n\nVerify\n\nGET /employees\n\nGET /employees/:id\n\nPOST /employees\n\nPUT /employees/:id\n\nDELETE /employees/:id\n\nPATCH /employees/:id/restore\n\nPagination\n\nSearch\n\nSorting\n\nDepartment Filter\n\nRole Filter\n\nStatus Filter\n\nDuplicate email\n\nSoft delete\n\nRestore\n\n=========================================================\nOUTPUT FORMAT\n=========================================================\n\nBefore changing code\n\nshow\n\n1. Files Created\n\n2. Files Modified\n\n3. Database Changes\n\n4. API Endpoints\n\n5. Why each file is changing\n\nWait for approval.\n\n=========================================================\nAFTER IMPLEMENTATION\n=========================================================\n\nProvide\n\nCompleted Features\n\nFiles Created\n\nFiles Modified\n\nDatabase Changes\n\nAPI Endpoints\n\nManual Testing Checklist\n\nRollback Plan\n\nKnown Limitations\n\nDo NOT start Sprint 3 automatically."
    items {
      text: "SPRINT 2 \342\200\223 EMPLOYEES MODULE IMPLEMENTATION\n\nSprint 1 has been completed successfully.\n\nSprint 1 is LOCKED.\n\n=========================================================\nDO NOT MODIFY\n=========================================================\n\nDo NOT modify\n\nserver.ts\n\npackage.json\n\nvite.config.ts\n\ntsconfig.json\n\ndatabase/db.ts\n\ndatabase/postgres.ts\n\nmiddlewares/\n\nutils/logger.ts\n\nauthentication/\n\nresponse middleware\n\nerror middleware\n\nvalidation middleware\n\nrate limiter\n\nDo not modify any file outside the Employees module unless it is required to fix a compile error.\n\n=========================================================\nOBJECTIVE\n=========================================================\n\nImplement a production-ready Employees Module.\n\nArchitecture must remain\n\nRoutes\n\342\206\223\n\nController\n\342\206\223\n\nService\n\342\206\223\n\nRepository\n\342\206\223\n\nPostgreSQL\n\nNo SQL outside repositories.\n\n=========================================================\nEMPLOYEE FEATURES\n=========================================================\n\nImplement\n\n\342\234\224 Employee CRUD\n\n\342\234\224 Pagination\n\n\342\234\224 Server-side Search\n\n\342\234\224 Department Filter\n\n\342\234\224 Role Filter\n\n\342\234\224 Status Filter\n\n\342\234\224 Sorting\n\n\342\234\224 Soft Delete\n\n\342\234\224 Restore\n\n\342\234\224 Employee Code Auto Generation\n\n\342\234\224 Profile Image\n\n\342\234\224 Emergency Contact\n\n\342\234\224 Bank Details\n\n\342\234\224 Salary Structure\n\n\342\234\224 Manager Assignment\n\n\342\234\224 Documents\n\n\342\234\224 Validation\n\n\342\234\224 Duplicate Email Prevention\n\n\342\234\224 Duplicate Employee Code Prevention\n\n=========================================================\nDATABASE\n=========================================================\n\nContinue using the existing Neon PostgreSQL connection.\n\nDo not create another database helper.\n\nDo not create another executeQuery().\n\nUse parameterized SQL only.\n\nNo string concatenation.\n\n=========================================================\nBACKEND\n=========================================================\n\nRepository\n\nOnly SQL.\n\nService\n\nBusiness rules.\n\nValidation.\n\nEmployee code generation.\n\nDuplicate checks.\n\nSalary calculations.\n\nController\n\nValidate request.\n\nCall service.\n\nReturn\n\n{\n  success,\n  message,\n  data\n}\n\nRoutes\n\nRouting only.\n\n=========================================================\nFRONTEND\n=========================================================\n\nCreate\n\nsrc/services/employeeService.ts\n\nEvery HTTP request must be inside this service.\n\nEmployeesPage.tsx\n\nmust not use\n\nfetch()\n\naxios()\n\ndirectly.\n\nUse employeeService only.\n\n=========================================================\nVALIDATION\n=========================================================\n\nValidate\n\nEmail\n\nPhone\n\nRole\n\nDepartment\n\nSalary\n\nRequired fields\n\nDuplicate email\n\nDuplicate employee code\n\n=========================================================\nTESTING\n=========================================================\n\nVerify\n\nGET /employees\n\nGET /employees/:id\n\nPOST /employees\n\nPUT /employees/:id\n\nDELETE /employees/:id\n\nPATCH /employees/:id/restore\n\nPagination\n\nSearch\n\nSorting\n\nDepartment Filter\n\nRole Filter\n\nStatus Filter\n\nDuplicate email\n\nSoft delete\n\nRestore\n\n=========================================================\nOUTPUT FORMAT\n=========================================================\n\nBefore changing code\n\nshow\n\n1. Files Created\n\n2. Files Modified\n\n3. Database Changes\n\n4. API Endpoints\n\n5. Why each file is changing\n\nWait for approval.\n\n=========================================================\nAFTER IMPLEMENTATION\n=========================================================\n\nProvide\n\nCompleted Features\n\nFiles Created\n\nFiles Modified\n\nDatabase Changes\n\nAPI Endpoints\n\nManual Testing Checklist\n\nRollback Plan\n\nKnown Limitations\n\nDo NOT start Sprint 3 automatically."
    }
  }
}
