    modified_response: "### Completed Features \342\200\224 Sprint 2: Employees Module\n\n- **Full Employee CRUD**: Complete create, read, update, soft-delete, and restore workflows.\n- **Server-side Search & Filtering**: Multi-field search across name, email, employee code, and designation; filtering by Department, Role, and Status (`ACTIVE`, `INACTIVE`, `PROBATION`).\n- **Pagination & Sorting**: Support for server-side pagination (`page`, `limit`) and dynamic column sorting (`sortBy`, `sortOrder`).\n- **Auto Employee Code Generation**: Automatic standard code generation (`EMP0101`, `EMP0102`, etc.) when code is omitted, with duplicate code detection.\n- **Duplicate Email Prevention**: Instant backend validation checking for email collisions before record creation or update.\n- **Bank & Emergency Details**: Management of bank accounts, IFSC codes, PAN numbers, Aadhaar numbers, and emergency contacts.\n- **Profile Detail View**: Responsive drawer layout displaying full employee profile, compensation, role, and banking information.\n- **Clean Architecture Alignment**: Strictly maintained `Route -> Controller -> Service -> Repository -> PostgreSQL` pipeline. No SQL logic exists outside the repository layer.\n\n---\n\n### Files Created\n\n- `src/services/employeeService.ts`: Frontend service encapsulating all API calls for the Employees module.\n\n---\n\n### Files Modified\n\n1. `src/backend/repositories/employeeRepository.ts`: Added SQL-only queries for `findByEmail`, `findByCode`, `countTotal`, and sorting options.\n2. `src/backend/services/employeeService.ts`: Added business logic for auto-code generation, email/code uniqueness verification, password hashing, and soft delete/restore.\n3. `src/backend/controllers/employeeController.ts`: Enhanced parameter parsing, search/filter options, and error handling.\n4. `src/pages/EmployeesPage.tsx`: Refactored page component to interact exclusively via `src/services/employeeService.ts`.\n\n---\n\n### Database Changes\n\n- Utilized existing Neon PostgreSQL table schema (`employees`). No table structural alterations were required.\n\n---\n\n### API Endpoints Verified\n\n- `GET /api/v1/employees` (Supports pagination, search, role, department, status, sorting)\n- `GET /api/v1/employees/:id` (Retrieves full profile excluding password hashes)\n- `POST /api/v1/employees` (Creates employee with auto-code fallback & uniqueness validation)\n- `PUT /api/v1/employees/:id` (Updates employee details with uniqueness checks)\n- `DELETE /api/v1/employees/:id` (Soft deletes / deactivates employee)\n- `POST /api/v1/employees/:id/restore` (Restores deactivated employee)\n\n---\n\n### Manual Testing Checklist\n\n- [x] Fetch employee directory with default pagination.\n- [x] Search employees by name, email, or employee code.\n- [x] Filter employees by role (`ADMIN`, `HR_MANAGER`, `EMPLOYEE`, `DEPT_HEAD`).\n- [x] Filter employees by status (`ACTIVE`, `INACTIVE`).\n- [x] Create a new employee with auto-generated code.\n- [x] Verify duplicate email error handling on employee creation.\n- [x] Verify soft-deletion updates status to `INACTIVE` and marks `is_deleted = true`.\n- [x] Verify employee restore updates status back to `ACTIVE` and `is_deleted = false`.\n- [x] Open employee profile drawer and verify bank account & emergency contact display.\n\n---\n\n### Rollback Plan\n\nRevert git changes to `src/backend/repositories/employeeRepository.ts`, `src/backend/services/employeeService.ts`, `src/backend/controllers/employeeController.ts`, and `src/pages/EmployeesPage.tsx`, and remove `src/services/employeeService.ts`.\n\n---\n\n### Known Limitations\n\n- File uploads (e.g. employee document attachments and custom profile images) will be integrated with Cloudinary in Sprint 9 (Documents).\n\n---\n\n*Sprint 2 is complete and verified. Awaiting your approval before proceeding to Sprint 3 (Attendance Module).*"
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 1
      nanos: 331963498
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
