    user_response: "SPRINT 3 APPROVED\n\nImplement Sprint 3 with the following additional enterprise requirements.\n\n====================================================\nDO NOT MODIFY\n====================================================\n\nDo NOT modify\n\nserver.ts\n\npackage.json\n\ndatabase connection\n\nSprint 1 middleware\n\nSprint 2 Employees module\n\nAuthentication\n\nLogger\n\nValidation middleware\n\n====================================================\nATTENDANCE ARCHITECTURE\n====================================================\n\nMaintain\n\nRoutes\n\n\342\206\223\n\nController\n\n\342\206\223\n\nService\n\n\342\206\223\n\nRepository\n\n\342\206\223\n\nPostgreSQL\n\nRepository contains SQL only.\n\nService contains all calculations.\n\nController validates and returns responses.\n\n====================================================\nATTENDANCE FEATURES\n====================================================\n\nImplement\n\n\342\234\223 Punch In\n\n\342\234\223 Punch Out\n\n\342\234\223 Break Start\n\n\342\234\223 Break End\n\n\342\234\223 Live Work Timer\n\n\342\234\223 Live Break Timer\n\n\342\234\223 Remaining Shift Timer\n\n\342\234\223 Late Arrival\n\n\342\234\223 Early Exit\n\n\342\234\223 Overtime\n\n\342\234\223 Attendance History\n\n\342\234\223 Monthly Calendar\n\n\342\234\223 Monthly Summary\n\n\342\234\223 Attendance Analytics\n\n\342\234\223 Manager Dashboard\n\n====================================================\nATTENDANCE STATUS\n====================================================\n\nSupport\n\nPRESENT\n\nLATE\n\nHALF_DAY\n\nABSENT\n\nON_LEAVE\n\nHOLIDAY\n\nWEEK_OFF\n\nREMOTE\n\nWORK_FROM_HOME\n\nFIELD_VISIT\n\n====================================================\nSHIFT MANAGEMENT\n====================================================\n\nSupport\n\nGENERAL\n\nMORNING\n\nEVENING\n\nNIGHT\n\nFLEXIBLE\n\nLate\n\nEarly Exit\n\nOvertime\n\nmust always be calculated from\n\nemployee shift\n\nnot hardcoded values.\n\n====================================================\nGEOFENCE\n====================================================\n\nNever hardcode office coordinates.\n\nRead\n\nlatitude\n\nlongitude\n\nradius\n\nfrom database.\n\nReturn\n\n{\ndistance,\ninsideGeofence,\nallowed\n}\n\n====================================================\nATTENDANCE ANALYTICS\n====================================================\n\nAdd APIs for\n\nAverage Login\n\nAverage Logout\n\nAverage Working Hours\n\nLate Count\n\nOvertime Count\n\nAttendance Percentage\n\nWeekly Trend\n\nMonthly Trend\n\n====================================================\nMANAGER DASHBOARD\n====================================================\n\nGET\n\n/api/v1/attendance/live\n\nReturn\n\nEmployees Working\n\nEmployees On Break\n\nEmployees Late\n\nEmployees On Leave\n\nEmployees Absent\n\nEmployees Remote\n\n====================================================\nAUDIT LOGGING\n====================================================\n\nEvery attendance action must create an audit log.\n\nPunch In\n\nPunch Out\n\nBreak Start\n\nBreak End\n\n====================================================\nSECURITY\n====================================================\n\nValidate\n\nLatitude\n\nLongitude\n\nEmployee ID\n\nShift ID\n\nReject invalid requests.\n\n====================================================\nPERFORMANCE\n====================================================\n\nUse indexes.\n\nAvoid N+1 queries.\n\nRepository should use optimized SQL.\n\n====================================================\nTESTING\n====================================================\n\nVerify\n\nPunch In\n\nPunch Out\n\nBreak Start\n\nBreak End\n\nLate\n\nEarly Exit\n\nOvertime\n\nAttendance Analytics\n\nManager Dashboard\n\nGeofence\n\nMonthly Calendar\n\nHistory\n\n====================================================\nOUTPUT\n====================================================\n\nAfter implementation provide\n\nFiles Created\n\nFiles Modified\n\nDatabase Queries Added\n\nAPI Endpoints\n\nManual Testing Checklist\n\nKnown Issues\n\nRollback Plan\n\nDo not begin Sprint 4 automatically."
