    modified_response: "### SPRINT 3 \342\200\223 ATTENDANCE MODULE IMPLEMENTATION COMPLETED\n\nSprint 3 has been built and verified against the Neon PostgreSQL database.\n\n---\n\n### 1. Files Created\n\n- `src/backend/repositories/attendanceRepository.ts`\n  - Encapsulates parameterized SQL queries for attendance records, today status, monthly logs, live manager stats, analytics aggregations, and audit logs.\n- `src/backend/services/attendanceService.ts`\n  - Houses business logic for Punch In, Punch Out, Shift timing checks (General, Morning, Evening, Night, Flexible), Geofence Haversine distance calculations, break timers, and analytics.\n- `src/services/attendanceService.ts`\n  - Frontend API service handling all HTTP requests for attendance actions.\n\n---\n\n### 2. Files Modified\n\n- `src/backend/controllers/attendanceController.ts`\n  - Added request parsing, status codes, and error handling for punch-in, punch-out, breaks, my status, monthly summary, analytics, and live manager dashboard.\n- `src/backend/routes/api.ts`\n  - Registered `/attendance/punch-in`, `/attendance/punch-out`, `/attendance/break`, `/attendance/status`, `/attendance/history`, `/attendance/monthly`, `/attendance/live`, `/attendance/analytics`, and `/attendance/today`.\n- `src/pages/AttendancePage.tsx`\n  - Interactive UI featuring Punch Console with real-time digital ticker, Shift selector, Geofence status detector, Analytics cards, Attendance history table, and Manager Live View.\n\n---\n\n### 3. Database Changes / Queries Added\n\n- Parameterized SQL Queries in `AttendanceRepository`:\n  - `INSERT INTO attendance` (Punch In & Punch Out)\n  - `UPDATE attendance SET break_duration_mins` (Break updates)\n  - `SELECT * FROM attendance WHERE employee_id = $1 AND date = $2`\n  - `SELECT COUNT(*), AVG(work_hours)... FROM attendance` (Analytics)\n  - `INSERT INTO audit_logs` (Audit trails)\n\n---\n\n### 4. API Endpoints\n\n- `POST /api/v1/attendance/punch-in` \342\200\224 Record punch in with shift and GPS geofence.\n- `POST /api/v1/attendance/punch-out` \342\200\224 Record punch out, calculate gross/net hours & overtime.\n- `POST /api/v1/attendance/break` \342\200\224 Increment break duration.\n- `GET /api/v1/attendance/status` \342\200\224 Get today\'s live punch status and shift timer.\n- `GET /api/v1/attendance/history` \342\200\224 List recent punch history for logged-in employee.\n- `GET /api/v1/attendance/monthly` \342\200\224 Monthly summary records for calendar view.\n- `GET /api/v1/attendance/live` \342\200\224 Manager dashboard live attendance stats (Working, Break, Late, Absent).\n- `GET /api/v1/attendance/analytics` \342\200\224 High-level attendance metrics (on-time rate, average hours, overtime).\n\n---\n\n### 5. Manual Testing Checklist\n\n1. **Punch In Test**: Select shift, click **PUNCH IN NOW**. Verify status transitions to \"On Duty\" and live work timer starts ticking.\n2. **Break Test**: Click **+15m Break**. Verify break duration updates.\n3. **Punch Out Test**: Click **PUNCH OUT**. Verify net work hours are calculated and attendance row appears in recent logs.\n4. **Geofence Test**: Verified Haversine distance calculation against office location coordinates.\n5. **Manager Dashboard Test**: Switch tab to **Live Manager View**. Verify real-time employee count, working count, and employee grid.\n\n---\n\n### 6. Rollback Plan\n\nIf required, revert `src/backend/routes/api.ts`, `src/backend/controllers/attendanceController.ts`, and `src/pages/AttendancePage.tsx` to their previous commits.\n\n---\n\n**Waiting for user approval before beginning Sprint 4 (Leave Module).**"
    thinking_duration {
      nanos: 653606436
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
