\nUpcoming Leave\n\nTeam Calendar\n\nDepartment Leave Summary\n\n====================================================\n\nFrontend\n\nCreate frontend leave service.\n\nNo direct fetch.\n\nNo direct axios.\n\n====================================================\n\nTesting\n\nApply Leave\n\nApprove\n\nReject\n\nCancel\n\nRestore Balance\n\nHalf Day\n\nMulti Day\n\nHoliday Validation\n\nConflict Detection\n\n====================================================\n\nOutput\n\nBefore implementation provide\n\nFiles Created\n\nFiles Modified\n\nDatabase Changes\n\nAPI Endpoints\n\nTesting Plan\n\nRollback Plan\n\nWait for approval."
