  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Defining Sprint 4.1 Tasks**\n\nI\'ve outlined Sprint 4.1\'s implementation steps. The focus is now on the backend controllers. I\'m prioritizing the creation of `leaveController.ts` and the relocation of leave-related logic from `attendanceController.ts` to maintain clear separation of concerns. The new file will export a dedicated `LeaveController`.\n\n\n**Expanding Leave Management Features**\n\nI\'m now fully immersed in implementing the expanded endpoints across `LeaveRepository`, `LeaveService`, and `LeaveController`, as well as updating `api.ts`. I\'m focusing specifically on the endpoints for editing and canceling leave applications, alongside bulk approval and the team calendar feature. Simultaneously, I\'m fleshing out the workflow with the full status transitions of `DRAFT`, `SUBMITTED`, `MANAGER_PENDING`, `HR_PENDING`, `APPROVED`, `REJECTED`, and `CANCELLED`. I\'m making sure status transitions work smoothly.\n\n\n"
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 6
      nanos: 757708123
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
