    thinking: "**Verifying Database Structure**\n\nI\'m now focused on the database directory structure for `src/backend/database_v2/`. I\'m evaluating the use of `@electric-sql/pglite` or a standard PostgreSQL pool. I have the folder structure requirements mapped out: `connection.ts`, `schema.ts`, and a `seed` directory. I\'m carefully verifying these elements meet the stated needs.\n\n\n**Defining Database Schema Files**\n\nI am now structuring the migration files, indexes, triggers, and the like with complete, error-free TypeScript and SQL. I\'m focusing on creating clean, production-ready code. I\'m taking the domains and tables from the prompt for `Authentication`, `Organization`, `Attendance`, and `Leave` as a basis to generate clean code files.\n\n\n**Expanding Database Tables**\n\nI\'m now generating the necessary tables for the database, including all the required basic fields across each of the domains listed. I\'ve begun creating schemas for `salary_structures`, `expense_categories`, `projects`, and other modules. I\'m ensuring that each table adheres to the consistent schema.\n\n\n**Defining Database Enums**\n\nI\'m now generating TypeScript and SQL definitions for PostgreSQL ENUMs. I\'m focusing on `enums.ts` which will include definitions for `EmployeeStatus`, `Gender`, `AttendanceStatus`, and numerous other statuses. I\'m expanding the table definitions, as I build out all the required constants to make a robust database.\n\n\n**Implementing Advanced Indexes**\n\nI\'m now focusing on performance optimizations for handling a high-concurrency employee database. Specifically, I am crafting B-Tree and partial indexes for tables with over 100,000 employees. I am creating files such as `indexes.ts`, which includes indexes using fields like `employee_id`, `department_id`, `branch_id`, and `created_at`. I\'m building soft-delete partial indexes too, to accommodate frequent querying on these fields. I\'m taking special care when implementing triggers, functions, and views to optimize them.\n\n\n\n"
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 12
      nanos: 626278704
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
