    modified_response: "I have designed and implemented the enterprise PostgreSQL database architecture for **THEIAKSHI ONE Enterprise HRMS** under `src/backend/database_v2/`.\n\n---\n\n### **Folder Structure**\n\n```\nsrc/backend/database_v2/\n\342\224\202\n\342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 connection.ts       # Database Pool Connection & Health Check Manager\n\342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 schema.ts           # Enterprise DDL creation script for 60+ tables\n\342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 seed.ts             # Complete enterprise database seeder\n\342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 migrations/         # Production SQL migration files\n\342\224\202   \342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200 001_init.sql    # Raw PostgreSQL 18 migration file\n\342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 indexes.ts          # B-Tree & Partial Soft-Delete Indexes\n\342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 triggers.ts         # Automated updated_at timestamp triggers\n\342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 functions.ts        # Stored procedures & PL/pgSQL routines\n\342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 views.ts            # Analytical & executive reporting views\n\342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 constraints.ts      # CHECK & UNIQUE integrity constraints\n\342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 enums.ts            # TypeScript Enums & SQL ENUM definitions\n\342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 transactions.ts     # Atomic multi-table service transaction handlers\n\342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 audit.ts            # Immutable Audit & Activity logger\n\342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200 README.md           # Technical documentation & reports\n```\n\n---\n\n### **Highlights & Compliance**\n\n1. **Strict Non-Destructive Architecture**: Existing frontend, controllers, services, repositories, and API routes were untouched.\n2. **Audit Standard**: Every single table includes `id`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `deleted_at`, `created_by`, and `updated_by`.\n3. **High-Concurrency Indexing**: Built with partial soft-delete indexes (`WHERE deleted_at IS NULL`) and composite UNIQUE constraints to easily support **100,000+ employees**.\n4. **Complete Module Coverage**:\n   - **Authentication**: `roles`, `permissions`, `role_permissions`, `employees`, `employee_sessions`, `refresh_tokens`, `login_history`, `password_reset`, `otp`\n   - **Organization**: `branches`, `departments`, `designations`, `teams`, `locations`, `holidays`, `week_off_rules`, `shifts`\n   - **Attendance**: `attendance`, `attendance_logs`, `attendance_breaks`, `attendance_requests`, `attendance_geofence`, `attendance_device`\n   - **Leave**: `leave_types`, `leave_policies`, `leave_balances`, `leave_requests`, `leave_approvals`, `leave_history`, `leave_encashment`\n   - **Payroll**: `salary_structures`, `salary_components`, `payroll`, `payroll_details`, `salary_revisions`, `bonuses`, `deductions`, `tax`, `pf`, `esi`\n   - **Expense**: `expense_categories`, `expenses`, `expense_approvals`, `expense_files`\n   - **Projects**: `projects`, `project_members`, `tasks`, `task_comments`, `task_files`\n   - **Recruitment**: `jobs`, `candidates`, `interviews`, `offers`\n   - **Assets**: `assets`, `asset_categories`, `asset_allocations`, `asset_history`\n   - **Helpdesk**: `tickets`, `ticket_comments`, `ticket_attachments`\n   - **Documents**: `employee_documents`, `company_documents`\n   - **Performance**: `performance_reviews`, `goals`, `kpis`\n   - **Communication**: `notifications`, `announcements`, `messages`\n   - **Planning**: `weekly_planners`, `timesheets`, `calendar_events`\n   - **AI**: `ai_logs`, `ai_prompts`, `ai_reports`\n   - **System**: `settings`, `audit_logs`, `activity_logs`, `system_logs`\n\n---\n\n### **Documentation & Reports Included in `README.md`**\n\n1. **ER Diagram (Mermaid)**\n2. **Database Flow Diagram**\n3. **Folder Structure**\n4. **Migration Order**\n5. **Foreign Key Map**\n6. **Index Report**\n7. **Performance Notes (100,000+ Employees)**\n8. **Repository Mapping Strategy**\n9. **API Compatibility Report**\n10. **PostgreSQL Optimization Report**"
